        "name": "05-astro-http-db-turso — Likes",
        "description": "Likes de la tabla Posts (Astro DB + Turso).\n\nColección principal del proyecto. Requiere runtime con Turso (`pnpm dev --remote` o Cloudflare Worker).\n\nGET /api/posts/likes/:slug — lectura.\nPOST /api/posts/likes/:slug — crea el post en Turso si no existe e incrementa likes (body: `{ \"likes\": number }`).\n\nUsa el entorno Local o Cloudflare. Variables: `postSlug`, `newPostId` (id libre para crear posts de prueba).",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "http://localhost:4321"
        },
        {
            "key": "postSlug",
            "value": "first-post"
        },
        {
            "key": "newPostId",
            "value": "post-postman-nuevo"
        }
    ],
